        NOVA: An <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agentic</span> Framework for Automated Histopathology Analysis and Discovery
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Vaidya%2C+A+J">Anurag J. Vaidya</a>, 
      
