    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        SWE-Bench Pro: Can AI <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> Solve Long-Horizon Software Engineering Tasks?
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Deng%2C+X">Xiang Deng</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Da%2C+J">Jeff Da</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Pan%2C+E">Edwin Pan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=He%2C+Y+Y">Yannis Yiming He</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ide%2C+C">Charles Ide</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Garg%2C+K">Kanak Garg</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lauffer%2C+N">Niklas Lauffer</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Park%2C+A">Andrew Park</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Pasari%2C+N">Nitin Pasari</a>, 
      
