        Parking of Connected Automated Vehicles: Vehicle Control, Parking Assignment, and Multi-<span class="search-hit mathjax">agent</span> Simulation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shen%2C+X">Xu Shen</a>, 
      
